<title>USA: Forest Lake ISD 831, Minn., won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Forest Lake ISD 831, Minn., won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $6.070 million of Forest Lake ISD 831, Minn., general obligation school bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 4.9035 percent.</p>
</text>
